  "contentHtml": "<P>저는 블록타임으로 수업을 해서 2시간 연강으로 과학수업을 하는데요.</P>\r\n<P>평소때나 실험수업때는 좋았는데... 요즘처럼 방학 직전에 수업하기 싫어하는 아이들 데리고 하기엔 힘드네요^^</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">오늘 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시간동안 수업해야 할 부분을 알려주고</SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시간동안 분할해서 퀴즈나 게임 같은 걸 섞어서 여유롭게 수업을 할 것인지</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시간동안 빡빡하게 하고 나머지 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시간은 학급 단합 놀이를 할까 선택하라고 하면</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모든 반이 후자를 택하더라구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아이들이 선택했기에 공부하는 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시간은 모든 아이들이 집중하여 수업을 참 잘 들어요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">열심히 수업하고 나머지 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시간동안 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&lt;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모둠별 팔씨름대회</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&gt;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 했어요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이건 제가 담임반이나 수업반에서 몇 년 전부터 해왔는데 참 호응이 좋았어요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">보통 팔씨름대회라고 하면 팔 힘이 센 아이가 있는 모둠이 이기곤 하는데요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제가 하는 경기 방식은 이렇답니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">먼저 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&lt;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">너희 반에는 가장 팔씨름 잘 할 것 같은 친구는 누구니</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?&gt; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">물어서 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명의 모둠장을 정합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제비뽑기로 여학생 몇 명</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">남학생 몇 명씩을 모둠장이 뽑아갑니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.&nbsp;</SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 여학생</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">남학생 따로 제비뽑기를 해서 모둠별로 남여 비율을 같이 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모둠원이 정해졌으면 모둠별로 모여서 선수들의 경기 순서를 정합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. (1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 선수 누구</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, 2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 선수 누구</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.....</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">다른 모둠에겐 비밀리에)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">두 모둠씩 경기를 하고 이긴 모둠끼리 한 번 더 경기를 해서 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">위를 정해서 상품을 주었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경기 방식은 두 모둠의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 선수를 제가 호명하면 둘이서 시합을 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.<SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"> (상대선수를 모르기 때문에 선수 호명만 해도..^^)</SPAN>&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이기더라도 계속해서 경기를 할 수 없고 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">그렇게 되면 힘 센 아이 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명만 있으면 그 모둠이 승리하기에</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">...) </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 선수는 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 선수와 3번 선수는 3번 선수와 경기를 해서 점수를 냅니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">두 선수가 남녀가 될 경우에는 손목을 잡고 경기를 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의외로 남녀일 때도 여학생이 이겨버리는 등 예상치 못한 결과들로 즐거울 수 있어요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">두 선수가 동성일 때는 빅매치가 되구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">설명이 잘 되었는지 모르겠네요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이번 주는 세 개반에서 했는데 다른 반 아이들에게도 소문이 나서 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">10</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개 반에서 다 해야 할 듯 해요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">^^ </SPAN></P></SPAN>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
